<title>VENEZUELA: Corimon Q3 net falls.</title>
<headline>Corimon Q3 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net 700 million bolivars vs 1.782 billion</p>
<p>Revs 14.558 billion bolivars vs 22.293 billion</p>
<p>NOTES: Period ended September 30.</p>
<p>Results are inflation-adjusted but not audited.</p>
<p>Corimon is a paints and packaging manufacturer.</p>
<p>Financial difficulties at foreign subisdiaries in the U.S. and Argentina saw Corimon suspended from trading on the Caracas and New York Stock Exchanges in February.</p>
<p>-- Caracas Newsroom 582 505 2600</p>
</text>
